      "head_commit": {
        "id": "ec781d86dae3da0e5cc9f84e904cad169a93b48d",
        "tree_id": "298f735a85ad51ad1b51dbbe97a1d1127b955c74",
        "message": "Give the Kotlin compile daemon enough heap to read material-icons-extended\n\nThe release build's :app:compileReleaseKotlin failed with\n\"Not enough memory to run compilation\" on the shared runner while the K2\ncompiler streamed material-icons-extended-release-api.jar through ASM to\nresolve SendAndArchiveKt for PlaylistDetailScreen.kt:504. The daemon's\ndefault 1.5 GB was not enough for that container on a constrained host.\n\ngradle.properties sized kotlin.daemon.jvmargs for small local boxes\n(-Xmx1280m), which is fine for a developer machine with a private daemon but\nstarves on the shared runner where the daemon has to compete with AAPT2, D8\nand R8 for the same host. Raise it to 2 GB with a matching metaspace.\n\nVerified locally: `:app:compileReleaseKotlin` with the new setting completes\nin 3m 15s, including the call site that previously OOM'd.",
        "timestamp": "2026-10-06T09:59:38Z",
        "author": {
          "name": "Siddhartha Mahapatra",
          "email": "itssubham29@gmail.com"
        },
        "committer": {
          "name": "Siddhartha Mahapatra",
          "email": "itssubham29@gmail.com"
        }
